  "step_1": "The decision reason can be applied to the decision problem. The relevant information includes the maximum and minimum outcomes of each lottery. Lottery A has a maximum outcome of 2500 Euros and a minimum outcome of 0 Euros. Lottery B has a maximum outcome of 2400 Euros and a minimum outcome of 2400 Euros. Since the maximum outcome of Lottery A (2500) is higher than that of Lottery B (2400), the reason would prefer Lottery A based on the maximum outcome. The minimum outcomes are not relevant for the decision under this reason, because the maximum outcomes differ.",
